{
  "Displays upcoming days as a list, with each day's appointments in time order. Days without appointments are omitted.": "",
  "`agenda` lists `agendaDuration` days, starting from the displayed date (7 by default). A multi-day appointment appears on each of its days, and an all-day appointment is labeled as such. The list is a list box, so the arrow keys move between rows, and Space and Enter act like a click and a double-click.": "",
  "Grouping by resource": "",
  "With `groups`, each group's days appear under its name. As in other views, a data source is asked only for the displayed days.": "",
  "`agendaRowTemplate` customizes a row's content, and `appointmentTooltipTemplate` customizes the tooltip here and in every view.": "",
  "Moves to the row above or below and selects it.": "",
  "Moves to the first or last row, or up or down one screen of rows.": "",
  "Shows the tooltip, like a click.": "",
  "Opens the form, like a double-click.": "",
  "Deletes the appointment, after confirmation.": "",
  "Today, and the next and previous days. `keys.agendaView` (A) shows the agenda.": "",
  "A list box. Each day, within its group, is a group of options named by the day.": "",
  "One option per appointment, with its text, its time, whether it continues and how it repeats. The focused row is the selected row.": "",
  "When there are no appointments, the list is omitted and a message appears instead.": "",
  "Units: the list, a day and the line above it, and a group name.": "",
  "Units: a day header and its parts.": "",
  "Units: a row and its side-by-side parts.": "",
  "Units: the time column, the appointment color (hidden unless a design language draws it), the text and the empty message.": "",
  "Plain token: the width of the time column.": "",
  "The number of days the agenda shows, starting from the displayed date. A view's own value takes precedence. Previous and next move by this number.": "",
  "With groups, each group's days appear under its name, with that group's appointments.": "",
  "A row's content: `{ appointment, start, end, text, time, allDay, date, group }`. The row keeps its color, keys and accessible name.": "",
  "The tooltip's content, in every view.": "",
  "\"No appointments\"": "\"Randevu yok\"",
  "The message shown when the displayed days have no appointments (`uiLocale`).": ""
}
